1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,901
If you let me have you

2
00:00:01,901 --> 00:00:04,604
we'll call the 300$ settled

3
00:00:04,938 --> 00:00:07,640
That sounds pretty fair to me

4
00:00:08,908 --> 00:00:10,777
But…

5
00:00:10,777 --> 00:00:13,179
I've never done this before

6
00:00:14,981 --> 00:00:17,117
Can't I pay you back some other way

7
00:00:17,117 --> 00:00:20,353
Like cleaning your place for three days

8
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:21,388
You said you'd do anything

9
00:00:21,388 --> 00:00:23,156
If not, then pay the 300

10
00:00:23,156 --> 00:00:25,458
That's…

11
00:00:25,458 --> 00:00:27,761
Are you trying to piss me off

12
00:00:27,761 --> 00:00:28,795
You already had your fun

13
00:00:28,795 --> 00:00:31,297
Now you can't pay

14
00:00:31,297 --> 00:00:33,800
And you won't even make it up to me

15
00:00:34,067 --> 00:00:36,336
So what exactly do you expect me to do

16
00:00:36,336 --> 00:00:38,538
If you keep being like this

17
00:00:38,905 --> 00:00:41,941
I'm calling the police for breaking in and rape

18
00:00:42,075 --> 00:00:43,343
Got it?

19
00:00:43,343 --> 00:00:46,446
O... okay

20
00:00:47,013 --> 00:00:47,814
I'll do it

21
00:00:47,814 --> 00:00:48,948
Do what?

22
00:00:48,948 --> 00:00:51,151
With you…

23
00:00:51,684 --> 00:00:54,554
I'll do it..

24
00:00:54,554 --> 00:00:56,222
Jesus…

25
00:00:56,222 --> 00:00:58,358
Anyone listening would think I begged for this

26
00:00:58,358 --> 00:00:59,759
Hey

27
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:01,394
Watch how you say it

28
00:01:01,394 --> 00:01:03,963
No… that's not it

29
00:01:05,598 --> 00:01:07,233
Say it… “please do me”

30
00:01:07,233 --> 00:01:08,601
What?

31
00:01:08,601 --> 00:01:11,271
Aren't you the one asking here

32
00:01:11,271 --> 00:01:13,339
I mean… yeah but

33
00:01:14,808 --> 00:01:17,911
Then go on say it

34
00:01:17,911 --> 00:01:19,913
Please… do me

35
00:01:22,882 --> 00:01:23,783
Please… do me…

36
00:01:23,783 --> 00:01:24,784
What was that?

37
00:01:24,784 --> 00:01:25,819
You'd rather pay 300?

38
00:01:25,885 --> 00:01:28,254
Please… do me!

39
00:02:10,530 --> 00:02:13,133
It might hurt at first.

40
00:02:14,067 --> 00:02:14,968
Ah... ah!!

41
00:02:14,968 --> 00:02:16,436
Ah..! It hurts!

42
00:02:16,703 --> 00:02:18,204
I'm not even all the way in yet.

43
00:02:18,204 --> 00:02:19,973
Ah... aagh! No!

44
00:02:20,206 --> 00:02:21,274
Ah..!

45
00:02:21,641 --> 00:02:23,276
Fuck, seriously!

46
00:02:25,111 --> 00:02:27,213
I'm telling you, it really hurts.

47
00:02:27,213 --> 00:02:29,649
Can't you go a little easier on me?

48
00:02:39,058 --> 00:02:40,960
This should do it, right?

49
00:03:05,251 --> 00:03:07,020
It feels... weird.

50
00:03:08,221 --> 00:03:09,022
Hah...

51
00:04:25,565 --> 00:04:27,700
Ah, it feels so good...

52
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:29,302
You're really feeling it, huh?

53
00:04:33,406 --> 00:04:34,607
I'm gonna cum.

54
00:05:07,940 --> 00:05:09,142
How do you feel

55
00:05:09,142 --> 00:05:10,276
You okay?

56
00:05:10,276 --> 00:05:12,111
I feel like I'm dying

57
00:05:12,111 --> 00:05:13,813
My back's killing me

58
00:05:13,813 --> 00:05:15,848
My legs are shaking

59
00:05:15,848 --> 00:05:17,717
You'll be fine by tomorrow

60
00:05:19,385 --> 00:05:21,120
You took it pretty well

61
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:24,090
Seriously… stop teasing me

62
00:05:24,090 --> 00:05:26,392
You're heading out right

63
00:05:28,261 --> 00:05:31,030
Yeah I should go

64
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:36,336
Can you recommend a good place to eat in Seoul

65
00:05:36,336 --> 00:05:37,970
A good place?

66
00:05:37,970 --> 00:05:39,839
What are you in the mood for

67
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:43,409
Korean's good, Japanese too

68
00:05:43,409 --> 00:05:45,545
If it's Japanese…

69
00:05:45,545 --> 00:05:49,115
There's a great sake-don place in Jamsil

70
00:05:49,115 --> 00:05:51,951
And a solid spot in Yeonnam for katsudon and gyudon

71
00:05:51,951 --> 00:05:57,190
There's also a place in Yongsan
with yakisoba and okonomiyaki

72
00:05:57,190 --> 00:05:59,559
Super authentic vibe

73
00:05:59,559 --> 00:06:02,462
Didn't come all the way to Seoul for a Japanese vibe

74
00:06:04,263 --> 00:06:06,999
Guess I'll grab some katsudon then

75
00:06:06,999 --> 00:06:08,201
Where was that again

76
00:06:08,201 --> 00:06:10,603
It's in Yeonnam…

77
00:06:11,337 --> 00:06:13,706
You're going all the way there right now?

78
00:06:13,706 --> 00:06:15,208
Where even is Yeonnam

79
00:06:15,208 --> 00:06:16,642
Near Hongdae

80
00:06:16,642 --> 00:06:18,244
Hongdae?

81
00:06:19,212 --> 00:06:20,179
Where's that

82
00:06:20,179 --> 00:06:22,215
Oh right

83
00:06:22,215 --> 00:06:24,183
You said you're here on a trip

84
00:06:24,183 --> 00:06:25,118
You don't know anything?

85
00:06:25,118 --> 00:06:28,020
It's my first time in Seoul

86
00:06:29,088 --> 00:06:31,491
Want me to show you around?

87
00:06:31,491 --> 00:06:32,892
Really?

88
00:06:32,892 --> 00:06:35,428
I'd love that

89
00:06:35,428 --> 00:06:39,332
I was just thinking
it'd be nice to have a friend here

90
00:06:40,933 --> 00:06:43,569
Then my guide fee is 100$ a day

91
00:06:43,569 --> 00:06:44,237
What?

92
00:06:44,237 --> 00:06:46,038
That's way too expensive

93
00:06:46,038 --> 00:06:48,174
Cut me a little slack

94
00:06:48,608 --> 00:06:50,476
I'll cover all your meals

95
00:06:50,476 --> 00:06:52,745
Hey in Seoul

96
00:06:52,745 --> 00:06:55,448
that'll cost way more than 100$

97
00:06:55,448 --> 00:06:57,316
Wait really?

98
00:06:57,316 --> 00:06:59,919
Try paying for everything yourself then

99
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,955
Then…

100
00:07:02,955 --> 00:07:04,957
We split meals

101
00:07:05,124 --> 00:07:06,325
I'll just buy coffee

102
00:07:06,325 --> 00:07:08,361
Wow…

103
00:07:08,361 --> 00:07:11,531
You're trying to cover a guide fee with one coffee

104
00:07:14,167 --> 00:07:15,802
Or…

105
00:07:15,802 --> 00:07:18,104
you wanna pay some other way again

106
00:07:18,104 --> 00:07:20,072
Man seriously…

107
00:07:29,315 --> 00:07:32,084
By the way how old are you

108
00:07:32,084 --> 00:07:34,287
Why are you asking all of a sudden

109
00:07:34,287 --> 00:07:35,688
Just…

110
00:07:35,688 --> 00:07:38,257
We're gonna be together for three days

111
00:07:38,424 --> 00:07:41,294
I should at least know your name and age

112
00:07:41,294 --> 00:07:43,496
Shin Jaehee, 24

113
00:07:43,496 --> 00:07:44,730
Huh?

114
00:07:44,730 --> 00:07:46,399
I'm 26 though

115
00:07:46,399 --> 00:07:47,700
So what

116
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:49,702
What… you want me to call you hyung

117
00:07:49,702 --> 00:07:51,337
Oh

118
00:07:53,139 --> 00:07:56,008
Are people in Seoul always this rude

119
00:07:56,008 --> 00:07:58,044
I can hear you

120
00:07:58,044 --> 00:07:59,445
Do you want to just go by yourself?

121
00:07:59,445 --> 00:08:01,447
No…

122
00:08:02,081 --> 00:08:04,517
Get dressed and come out

123
00:08:04,517 --> 00:08:06,085
Hey give me a second

124
00:08:06,085 --> 00:08:08,955
I'm going to have a smoke.. so take your time

125
00:08:09,489 --> 00:08:11,257
Ah…

126
00:08:12,391 --> 00:08:13,993
What a shitty attitude

127
00:08:13,993 --> 00:08:15,928
Cocky little punk…

128
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:24,800
"Seoul Trip"
